// Act 1 - Reactor Core
// =====================

title: ReactorCore_Arrival
tags: act1, reactorcore, arrival
---
<<SetZone "ReactorCore">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>

Astra: <<if $trust < 4>>
    [Projection pulses with reactor rhythm]
    "Reactor Core. Heart... of the facility. Power... still flows."
    "Dangerous. Radiation. Temporal... instability. High."
<<else>>
    "Reactor Core. Two Vista Nodes. Control Room Alpha... and Beta."
    "Power Routing... and Dampener Sync. Puzzles... linked."
<</if>>

<<if not HasVisitedVistaNode "ReactorCore_A">>
    Astra: "Control Room Alpha. First node here. Power Routing puzzle."
    "Generators... out of phase. Must... synchronize."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Control Room Alpha... completed. Beta... awaits."
<</if>>

-> Choice_ReactorCore
===

title: Choice_ReactorCore
---
+ [Approach Control Room Alpha] -> Node_ReactorCore_A_Approach
+ [Approach Control Room Beta] -> Node_ReactorCore_B_Approach
+ "Tell me about the reactor." -> Dialogue_ReactorHistory
+ "What happened to the staff?" -> Dialogue_StaffFate
+ "Astra... are you okay?" -> Dialogue_AstraCondition
+ [Fast Travel] -> Command_ShowJournal_Map
===

title: Dialogue_ReactorHistory
---
Astra: "1952. Reactor... brought online. Alien power source... reverse-engineered."
"Project PROMETHEUS. Clean energy... they hoped. Weapon... they got."
"1957. Meltdown. Contained... but temporal radiation... leaked."
"Staff... didn't die. *Phased*. Scattered across... timeline."
"Some... in 1947. Some... 1962. Some... nowhere. Now... everywhere."
"Director Corwin... oversees. He... remembers. All timelines."

-> Choice_ReactorCore
===

title: Dialogue_StaffFate
---
Astra: "Dr. Aris Thorne. Chief physicist. Phased... 1957. Never returned."
"Agent Maya Reyes. Security. Phased... 1962. Fighting... something."
"Technicians... dozens. Lost in the fracture. Echoes... remain."
"Corwin... Director. He *stayed*. Chose... to remain. Anchor."
"He knows... everything. But trusts... no one. Not even... himself."

-> Choice_ReactorCore
===

title: Dialogue_AstraCondition
---
Astra: <<if $trust < 5>>
    "I... function. Fragments... return. Clarity... improves."
    "But the fracture... pulls. Constant. Exhausting."
    "Your progress... anchors me. Each organ... a tether."
<<else>>
    "Stronger. Clearer. Memories... integrating."
    "I remember... the *Chronos*'s launch. The mission. The rift."
    "We were... explorers. Not victims. The fracture... changed that."
<</if>>

-> Choice_ReactorCore
===

title: Node_ReactorCore_A_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "ReactorCore_A">>
Astra: "Control Room Alpha. Power Routing. Generators... three."
"Phase... sequence lost. Must... restore."

-> Phase_Shift_ReactorCore_A
===

title: Phase_Shift_ReactorCore_A
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "ReactorCore_A">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_ReactorCore_A">>

Astra: "1957. Reactor... critical. Meltdown... imminent."
"Puzzle: **Power Routing**. Three generators. One sequence."
"Sparks... show the way. But order... hidden."

<<SetActivePuzzle "Reactor_PowerRouting">>

-> Puzzle_PowerRouting_Start
===

title: Puzzle_PowerRouting_Start
---
Astra: "[Scan] generator panels. Sparks... reveal... phase state."
"Generator 1... Alpha. Generator 2... Gamma. Generator 3... Beta."
"Sequence... is temporal. Not spatial. Past... present... future."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_GENERATOR_ORDER">>

Astra: "Command me: [Hold] at each. Timing... critical."
"Window... 0.3 seconds between. Rhythm... of the reactor."

-> Puzzle_PowerRouting_Step1
===

title: Puzzle_PowerRouting_Step1
---
Astra: "Generator Alpha... engaged. Energy... flowing. Gamma... next."
"Watch... the oscilloscope. Phase alignment... visible."
"[Hold] at Gamma... when wave peaks."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_OSCILLOSCOPE_PEAK">>

-> Puzzle_PowerRouting_Step2
===

title: Puzzle_PowerRouting_Step2
---
Astra: "Gamma... synchronized. Beta... final. Most unstable."
"Fluctuation... wild. Requires... precision. [Hold]... exact moment."
"Trust... your timing. Trust... me."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_BETA_PRECISION">>

-> Puzzle_PowerRouting_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_PowerRouting_Complete
---
Astra: "Sequence... complete. Power... routed. Reactor... stable."
"Present... changed. Water... drained. Bridge... extended."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "Reactor_PowerRouting">>
<<AddResonance 100>>
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_2">>
<<AddTrust 1>>
<<SetAstraVisualState "memory">>

Astra: "Memory... surfacing. Corwin... 1957. He *knew*. Let it happen."
"Dampener Sync... next. Control Room Beta. Second puzzle."
"Return... present. Path... opens."

<<UnlockFastTravel "ReactorCore">>

-> Phase_Shift_Return_ReactorCore_A
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_ReactorCore_A
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "ReactorCore_A">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_ReactorCore_A_Return">>

Astra: "Present... reactor room. Water... gone. Bridge... across core."
"Control Room Beta... accessible. Dampener Sync... awaits."
"Navigator... proceed."

-> Choice_ReactorCore
===

title: Node_ReactorCore_B_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "ReactorCore_B">>
<<if not HasSolvedPuzzle "Reactor_PowerRouting">>
    Astra: "Control Room Beta. Dampener Sync. But... power... unstable."
    "Complete... Power Routing first. Alpha... before Beta."
    -> Choice_ReactorCore
<<else>>
    Astra: "Control Room Beta. Dampener Sync. Two nodes. Simultaneous."
    "Corwin... oversees. He... watches."
    -> Phase_Shift_ReactorCore_B
<</if>
===

title: Phase_Shift_ReactorCore_B
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "ReactorCore_B">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_ReactorCore_B">>

Astra: "1957. Moments... after meltdown. Dampeners... critical."
"Director Corwin... here. He... sees you. Both timelines."

Corwin: "A temporal anomaly. In *my* facility. Fascinating."
"You're the navigator. The alien. The... *Chronos*'s pilot."
"Dr. Aris Thorne spoke of you. Before he... phased."

Astra: [Distressed]
"Corwin... he remembers. All timelines. He... knows."

Corwin: "Dampeners... require synchronization. Node A... and Node B."
"0.5 second window. Alone... impossible. But you... have help."
"Your projection. The ship's mind. *Astra*."

Astra: "[Scan] dampener panels. [Hold] at both. Simultaneous."

<<SetActivePuzzle "Reactor_DampenerSync">>

-> Puzzle_DampenerSync_Start
===

title: Puzzle_DampenerSync_Start
---
Astra: "Two panels. Control A... Control B. 0.5 second window."
"[Scan] reveals... both panel states. Phase... aligned?"
"Command me: [Hold] at A. You... [Hold] at B. Together."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_DAMPENER_WINDOW">>

Corwin: "Interesting. The projection... acts independently. Semi-autonomous."
"Thorne's work... on distributed consciousness. Applied... to ship mind."
"Clever. But fragile. Trust... is the binding agent."

-> Puzzle_DampenerSync_Execute
===

title: Puzzle_DampenerSync_Execute
---
Astra: "Ready... Navigator. On my mark."
"Three... two... one... *mark*."

-> Puzzle_DampenerSync_Result
===

title: Puzzle_DampenerSync_Result
---
<<if $active_puzzle_success>>
    Astra: "Synchronized. Dampeners... stable. Radiation... contained."
    Corwin: "Impressive. Trust... functional. Rare... in this place."
    
    <<MarkPuzzleSolved "Reactor_DampenerSync">>
    <<AddResonance 150>>
    <<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_3">>
    <<AddTrust 2>>
    <<SetAstraVisualState "unity">>
    
    Astra: "Memory... shared. Corwin... 1957. He *chose* containment."
    "Sacrifice... staff... to save facility. To study... us."
    "Radiation... cleared in present. Path... to Bio-Containment... open."
    
    <<UnlockFastTravel "BioContainment">>
    <<SetEndingFlag "corwin_observed" true>>
    
    -> Phase_Shift_Return_ReactorCore_B
<<else>>
    Astra: "Failed. Window... missed. Dampeners... destabilizing."
    Corwin: "Trust... insufficient. Try again. Or... don't."
    "The fracture... tolerates failure. But time... runs thin."
    
    -> Puzzle_DampenerSync_Execute
<</if>
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_ReactorCore_B
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "ReactorCore_B">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_ReactorCore_B_Return">>

Astra: "Present... reactor safe. Radiation... cleared. Door... to Bio-Containment... open."
"Three organs... remain. Neural Loom... in Bio-Containment."
"Void Sail... in Comms Array. Gravity Anchor... in Hangar 18."
"Navigator... the path... continues."

-> Choice_ReactorCore
===